The Pit~
The pit narrows between walls that show different layers of disturbed ground.
Coarse rubble forms a broken skirt below firmer material, with pale fragments
trapped in darker earth. One projecting stone has been rubbed smooth along the
upper face, although the surrounding edges remain sharp. The confined depth
makes the skyward opening feel less like an exit than a measure of how much
lies overhead.`x
