`dThe Portalstone`w~
The Portalstone stands within a close arrangement of worn surfaces, a single
more deliberate shape among them. Shallow lines cross the stone and continue
around the edges without revealing a complete pattern from one angle. The
surrounding floor remains spare. The place draws attention through the
contrast between the marked slab and the ordinary material around it, the
carved lines seeming sharper each time the eye returns to them.`x
